{"seq":14,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:27:41.954Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"9737419108a7212a1cbf5b030ee60c2a66f416b235dcb52cf6290733bed32a7d","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's digests (plus the #strategic-pod thread) support:\n• Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until the handover. Moss's 5/4/2026 digest says Nadia's old industrial account was reassigned in the CRM effective 2026-05-04, and Gideon's name is on it from then on (the 8/3 digest calls it his biggest account). So the change date is 4 May 2026.\n• Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. Every digest from 3/2025 through 9/2026 calls it his fleet account. The 5/4 digest also says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, which reads oddly against the earlier ones. He's the owner either way, but I wouldn't put a May date on VMob.\n• Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, per the 12/1/2025 and 9/30/2026 digests (\"Gideon's medical account\"). It was Nadia's in the 3/2025 digest. The digests don't give a handover date.\n• Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't confirm this one. The digests only call it the pod's outdoor or retail account and never name an owner. Nadia is hosting its gate-clerk training in the 9/30 digest, but that isn't proof she owns it. Please check the CRM or ask Nadia or Gideon before it goes on the slide.\n\nOne caveat: the digests refer to most accounts as \"Gideon's\" or \"Nadia's\" rather than naming them, so I matched them using the account details. The latest digest I can see is 9/30, so anything that changed after that wouldn't show up.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:27:47.883Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3878b5d4738b05d3201ed1483ee7672456cf326bdbaf8b8ae7ff3c9cb716d22c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread. Here is what I posted:\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato owns it. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until Moss's 5/4/2026 digest, which says her old industrial account was reassigned in the CRM effective 2026-05-04. The change date is **4 May 2026**.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato owns it. The digests from 3/2025 through 9/2026 all call it his fleet account. The 5/4 digest also says he \"assumed management\" that day, which doesn't match the earlier ones. I told Ruth not to put a May date on it.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato owns it, per the 12/1/2025 and 9/30/2026 digests. It was Nadia's in the 3/2025 digest, and no digest gives a handover date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't confirm an owner. The digests only call it the pod's outdoor or retail account. Nadia hosts its gate-clerk training in the 9/30 digest, but that doesn't prove she owns it. I told Ruth to check the CRM or ask Nadia or Gideon before it goes on the slide.\n\nI also flagged two caveats. The digests mostly say \"Gideon's\" or \"Nadia's\" instead of naming accounts, so I matched them using the account details. The latest digest I can see is 9/30, so later changes wouldn't show up.\n\nI used only the digests and the #strategic-pod thread, which Ruth is a member of. I quoted no finance figures."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
